    "created_at": "2019-05-07T14:23:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-07T14:23:39Z",
    "body": "Nah, given how poorly optimized getElementsByClassName and HTMLCollection is, you're much better off using querySelector(All).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
