    "created_at": "2019-05-07T14:33:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-07T14:33:35Z",
    "body": "Because the spec makes it hard, indeed. In particular the liveness of HTMLCollection is much worse than the static NodeLists returned by querySelectorAll.\r\n\r\n(And no worries, happy to help!)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
