    "created_at": "2019-05-07T14:46:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-07T14:46:39Z",
    "body": "FWIW, we have live `NodeList` objects that can be iterated, but I do recall us being okay with `HTMLCollection` not getting it due to all the APIs using it in general being discouraged.",
